    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20947" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hōroscŏpĭcus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		horoscopus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>indicating the hour</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vasa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					2, 72, 74, § 182</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Relating to nativities</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">libri,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Fulg. Myth. 1, 12 al.</span></i>
			—As <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hōroscŏ-pĭca</span></b> ,
				ae, f., <i>the casting of
				nativities</i>, Mythogr. Lat. 3, 13.</div>
